 content_id = E'## Final Project dan Portofolio\n\n> 🚀 Sesi **Upscale** — tersedia untuk peserta jalur Extended.\n\n### 1. Panduan Final Project End-to-End\n- Ruang lingkup dan ekspektasi final project\n- Kriteria penilaian (**rubrik**)\n- Timeline pengerjaan\n\n### 2. Menyusun Portofolio Profesional\n- Menonjolkan **proses berpikir**, bukan hanya hasil akhir\n- Mempresentasikan project di LinkedIn/platform lain untuk recruiter\n\n> **Praktik:** Susun portofolio profesional.',
 content_en = E'## Final Project and Portfolio\n\n> 🚀 **Upscale** session — available to Extended-track learners.\n\n### 1. End-to-End Final Project Guide\n- Scope and expectations of the final project\n- Grading criteria (**rubric**)\n- Work timeline\n\n### 2. Building a Professional Portfolio\n- Highlight your **thinking process**, not just the final result\n- Present the project on LinkedIn/other platforms for recruiters\n\n> **Practice:** Build a professional portfolio.'
